  "name": "Evolving Skies Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Players got the boxes at unofficial Evolving Skies prerelease events on the weekends of 14–15 and 21–22 August 2021, the first prereleases in over a year; shops that could not hold events sold them. Each box held four Evolving Skies booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Evolving Skies logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Eldegoss, Regieleki and Zoroark, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Sword & Shield's non-holo Professor's Research, first found in that expansion's box.",
